 "comment": "Android dropper/loader (com.hagaseca.thost9), delivered through an ADB shell installer. The APK has no native libraries; encrypted assets/hg decrypts to a DEX loaded at runtime. Stage 2 uses package th9 and service com.hagaseca.thost9.Fore. C2 WebSocket endpoint https://test.hagaseca.com/ws over TLS with a trust-all TrustManager; sends hg-token (MD5) and hg-type: kita. Downloads tc9.dex and loads it through dalvik.system.InMemoryDexClassLoader. Accessibility service com.hagaseca.thost9.AS supports screen-content access and gestures.",
